<title>USA: Boatmen's says others sought to buy it.</title>
<headline>Boatmen's says others sought to buy it.</headline>
<dateline>ST. LOUIS 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Boatmen's Bancshares Inc said Friday there were several other parties interested in acquiring the bank holding company, which announced a $9.5 billion deal to be acquired by NationsBank Corp.</p>
<p>&quot;Yes, there were several interested parties,&quot; Boatmen's chairman Andrew Craig III said in a news conference. &quot;Very strong interested parties.&quot;</p>
<p>He did not name the parties.</p>
<p>--Reuters Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787</p>
